<title>NETHERLANDS: SIMAC FIRST HALF NET JUMPS 45 PERCENT.</title>
<headline>SIMAC FIRST HALF NET JUMPS 45 PERCENT.</headline>
<dateline>VELDHOVEN, Netherlands 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half 1996.</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     1.17 vs  0.82 </p>
<p>    Net profit			     2.05 vs  1.41</p>
<p>    Turnover			     118.72 vs 79.33</p>
<p>Note - Full name of company is Simac Techniek NV</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     3.43 vs  2.35</p>
<p>    Cashflow per share (guilders)    3.00 vs  2.02</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said in a statement it expected a full</p>
<p>year turnover of around 275 million guilders, with operating</p>
<p>profit up at least 50 percent and net at least 30 percent</p>
<p>higher.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam Newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
